      "values": {
        "text": {
          "Text": "Mirror folds the picture about a line through its center, so a drifting noise becomes an inkblot with two matching halves. Set Mode to Mirror XY for four quarters, or to a Flip for a plain upside-down. Slide Mix down to watch the picture walk into its own reflection."
        }
